                                "text": "Curies are a reserved link relation acting as a base URL that is expanded upon by each term. In this example we will define a curie ex that references the URI https://api.example.com/docs/rels/{rel}. Curies are expanded by postfixing the curie name with a : followed by the name of the resource."
